{"html":"<!-- https://homegroupsapp.wordpress.com/portions/vayikra/ -->\n\n<style>\n  .week24-commentary {\n    --week24-bg: #0b1018;\n    --week24-panel: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.045);\n    --week24-panel-strong: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.075);\n    --week24-line: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.11);\n    --week24-text: #edf2f7;\n    --week24-muted: #aab5c5;\n    --week24-gold: #efc675;\n    --week24-blue: #86c9ff;\n    width: min(100%, 760px);\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    color: var(--week24-text);\n    font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n  }\n\n  .week24-commentary * {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  .week24-commentary a {\n    color: var(--week24-blue);\n    overflow-wrap: anywhere;\n    text-underline-offset: 0.18em;\n  }\n\n  .week24-hero {\n    position: relative;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    padding: clamp(1.5rem, 6vw, 2.75rem);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(239, 198, 117, 0.24);\n    border-radius: 1.5rem;\n    background:\n      radial-gradient(circle at 90% 0%, rgba(134, 201, 255, 0.16), transparent 38%),\n      radial-gradient(circle at 0% 100%, rgba(239, 198, 117, 0.14), transparent 42%),\n      linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.065), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.025));\n    box-shadow: 0 1.25rem 3rem rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.28);\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  .week24-hero h1 {\n    margin: 0;\n    color: #fff4d8;\n    font: 800 clamp(2rem, 9vw, 3.5rem)/1.05 Georgia, serif;\n    letter-spacing: -0.035em;\n  }\n\n  .week24-hero .week24-hebrew {\n    display: block;\n    margin-top: 0.55rem;\n    color: var(--week24-gold);\n    font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 5vw, 1.5rem);\n    font-weight: 750;\n  }\n\n  .week24-hero em {\n    display: block;\n    margin-top: 0.55rem;\n    color: var(--week24-muted);\n    font-size: 1rem;\n    font-weight: 500;\n  }\n\n  .week24-section {\n    margin-top: 1.1rem;\n    padding: clamp(1.15rem, 4vw, 1.75rem);\n    border: 1px solid var(--week24-line);\n    border-radius: 1.15rem;\n    background: var(--week24-panel);\n  }\n\n  .week24-section > h2 {\n    margin: 0 0 1rem;\n    color: #fff4d8;\n    font: 750 clamp(1.25rem, 5vw, 1.65rem)/1.2 Georgia, serif;\n  }\n\n  .week24-section > p:first-of-type {\n    margin-top: 0;\n  }\n\n  .week24-section > p:last-child {\n    margin-bottom: 0;\n  }\n\n  .week24-readings {\n    display: grid;\n    gap: 0.75rem;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    list-style: none;\n  }\n\n  .week24-reading {\n    display: grid;\n    gap: 0.3rem;\n    padding: 1rem;\n    border: 1px solid var(--week24-line);\n    border-radius: 0.9rem;\n    background: var(--week24-panel-strong);\n  }\n\n  .week24-reading strong {\n    color: var(--week24-gold);\n    font-size: 0.76rem;\n    letter-spacing: 0.1em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n  }\n\n  .week24-reading .week24-audio {\n    color: var(--week24-muted);\n    font-size: 0.78rem;\n  }\n\n  .week24-outline {\n    display: grid;\n    gap: 0.55rem;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    list-style: none;\n  }\n\n  .week24-outline li {\n    padding: 0.7rem 0.8rem;\n    border-left: 3px solid rgba(239, 198, 117, 0.7);\n    border-radius: 0 0.65rem 0.65rem 0;\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.035);\n  }\n\n  .week24-resources {\n    display: grid;\n    gap: 0.7rem;\n  }\n\n  .week24-resources a {\n    display: block;\n    padding: 0.85rem 1rem;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(134, 201, 255, 0.2);\n    border-radius: 0.8rem;\n    background: rgba(134, 201, 255, 0.06);\n  }\n\n  @media (min-width: 680px) {\n    .week24-readings {\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));\n    }\n  }\n\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {\n    .week24-commentary a {\n      transition: color 160ms ease, border-color 160ms ease, background 160ms ease;\n    }\n\n    .week24-commentary a:hover {\n      color: #c5e8ff;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<article class=\"week24-commentary\">\n  <header class=\"week24-hero\">\n    <h1>Vayikra <span aria-hidden=\"true\">|</span> <span class=\"week24-hebrew\" lang=\"he\" dir=\"rtl\">ויקרא</span> <span aria-hidden=\"true\">|</span> <em>“He called “</em></h1>\n  </header>\n\n  <section class=\"week24-section\" aria-labelledby=\"week24-readings-title\">\n    <h2 id=\"week24-readings-title\">Weekly Readings</h2>\n    <ul class=\"week24-readings\">\n      <li class=\"week24-reading\">\n        <strong>Torah:</strong>\n        <a href=\"https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Leviticus+1%3A1-5%3A26&amp;version=TLV\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Read\">Leviticus 1:1-5:26</a>\n        <a class=\"week24-audio\" href=\"http://audio.esvbible.org/hw/03001001-03005019″%5D\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://audio.esvbible.org/hw/03001001-03005019″%5D</a>\n      </li>\n      <li class=\"week24-reading\">\n        <strong>Prophets:</strong>\n        <a href=\"https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Isaiah+43%3A21-44%3A23&amp;version=TLV\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Read\">Isaiah 43:21-44:23</a>\n        <a class=\"week24-audio\" href=\"http://audio.esvbible.org/hw/23043021-23044023″%5D\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://audio.esvbible.org/hw/23043021-23044023″%5D</a>\n      </li>\n      <li class=\"week24-reading\">\n        <strong>Gospel:</strong>\n        <a href=\"https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Mark+7%3A1-30&amp;version=TLV\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Read\">Mark 7:1-30</a>\n        <a class=\"week24-audio\" href=\"http://audio.esvbible.org/hw/41007001-41007030″%5D\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://audio.esvbible.org/hw/41007001-41007030″%5D</a>\n      </li>\n    </ul>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"week24-section\" aria-labelledby=\"week24-introduction-title\">\n    <h2 id=\"week24-introduction-title\">Introduction</h2>\n    <p>The title “Leviticus” is derived from the Greek Septuagint (LXX) version of the Torah. The book of Leviticus is predominantly concerned with Levitical rituals. An older Hebrew name for the book was “The Laws of the Priesthood,” but in Judaism today, it is referred to by the name <em>Vayikra</em> (ויקרא), which means “And He called.” <em>Vayikra</em> is the first Hebrew word of the book, which begins by saying, “And the LORD called to Moses and spoke to him from inside the tent of meeting” (Leviticus 1:1).</p>\n    <p>Leviticus describes the sacrificial service and the duties of the priests. It also introduces ritual purity, the biblical diet, the calendar of appointed times, laws of holiness and laws relating to redemption, vows and tithes. In addition, Leviticus discourses on ethical instruction and holiness. The twenty-fourth reading from the Torah is eponymous with the Hebrew name of the book it introduces: <em>Vayikra</em>. This portion introduces the sacrificial service and describes five different types of sacrifices.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"week24-section\" aria-labelledby=\"week24-torah-title\">\n    <h2 id=\"week24-torah-title\">Torah Outline</h2>\n    <ul class=\"week24-outline\">\n      <li>Leviticus 1:1 | The Burnt Offering</li>\n      <li>Leviticus 2:1 | Grain Offerings</li>\n      <li>Leviticus 3:1 | Offerings of Well-Being</li>\n      <li>Leviticus 4:1 | Sin Offerings</li>\n      <li>Leviticus 5:14 | Offerings with Restitution</li>\n    </ul>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"week24-section\" aria-labelledby=\"week24-prophets-title\">\n    <h2 id=\"week24-prophets-title\">Prophets</h2>\n    <ul class=\"week24-outline\">\n      <li>Isaiah 43:1 | Restoration and Protection Promised</li>\n      <li>Isaiah 44:1 | God’s Blessing on Israel</li>\n      <li>Isaiah 44:9 | The Absurdity of Idol Worship</li>\n      <li>Isaiah 44:21 | Israel Is Not Forgotten</li>\n    </ul>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"week24-section\" aria-labelledby=\"week24-aleph-tav-title\">\n    <h2 id=\"week24-aleph-tav-title\">Hidden Aleph-Tav's</h2>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"week24-section\" aria-labelledby=\"week24-kids-title\">\n    <h2 id=\"week24-kids-title\">For Kids</h2>\n    <div class=\"week24-resources\">\n      <a href=\"http://emetministries.org/wp-content/uploads/2014/10/Torah-Time-23-Vayikra.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">http://emetministries.org/wp-content/uploads/2014/10/Torah-Time-23-Vayikra.pdf</a>\n      <a href=\"http://www.restorationoftorah.org/images/torahportions/children/VayikraChildren.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.restorationoftorah.org/images/torahportions/children/VayikraChildren.pdf</a>\n      <a href=\"http://www.chabad.org/kids/article_cdo/aid/608096/jewish/Vayikra.htm\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.chabad.org/kids/article_cdo/aid/608096/jewish/Vayikra.htm</a>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"week24-section\" aria-labelledby=\"week24-deeper-title\">\n    <h2 id=\"week24-deeper-title\">For Deeper Learning</h2>\n    <div class=\"week24-resources\">\n      <a href=\"http://ladderofjacob.com/2016/03/17/aleph/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Deeper Learning\">http://ladderofjacob.com/2016/03/17/aleph/</a>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</article>\n"}
